  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d52c5bd4fc9df8e72c80b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想着那种奇怪的事会没办法跑啦。\\n爽快地拿下第一名，就只要那样就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db1f8956448b0b3169983d1f5bfc543f7e10f2155e70f1292397621d2c5551e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "61"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/61"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0308c32c60e62e3a5d2a65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……不论是这场决赛还是竞赛后的\\n限时特卖都一定要获胜～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b82ea8faa9fa7df5deb40892db84067605479861d4b0422ef5c200023122701",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "610"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/610"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b944317c6956b512166ea8e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连原本以为根本办不到的我，如今也\\n来到这里了。所以我会相信自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4069c974a625a3c49472d7220f22adea25f73d8e3b5a2cc7b2a359d3e65f08d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "611"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/611"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:712aafd59361281efe696fbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是我试作的运动饮料。不过味道有问题，\\n难喝到像是异次元的物质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c35c5428b1afd55b570f0f3f122a1279871a4f386167e81cef2105375f7f4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "612"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/612"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca355741529a9252028f79d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，期待到受不了啊！超越极限、\\n肉体的可能性！感觉就要接近真理了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10ce5789d0fb692a91032e473024f6b2e0476aa9bc3c4c84e079fb4ea10675d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "613"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/613"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c54bcc925da1773e960032",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不用说我也会这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7301e70162a0f140a53c893639138e5e0b87e379beca513dc361dd77bfb949b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "614"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/614"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc8d5ca8bcdaa17854a5cfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "给重要的家人。\\n……希望今晚的夜空晴朗无云。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b6eba04d92158f6bb6209d659047afff81148fb16a41501f7c1f0e817dcca8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "615"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/615"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8e1a877d0853ef52ed5089",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～真是绝景，绝景啊。\\n有值得打倒的对手在，让我跃跃欲试呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38623d8eb414fb95f3dfe1e7cf3e4d5bf007b27ebcfdc1212bf6dc72369c8c1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "616"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/616"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae446540696e5dc1dd034031",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有！！因为那些话\\n就算没说出口也传达得出去嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a3718add3dafe910e93e042696bf2cb742975c11ffb24f8e0bc210d4a38369",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "617"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/617"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433c43e5fe523912906610e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时候当然是在心里大喊万岁──！\\n……咦？还是太棒啦──也说不定！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ea3ede6803fcd418da77b36b697ca6b3f1d9fc84e3aef36eccbdf5d68fe123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "618"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/618"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b326f28893173f2d67b7f940",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "100%中的100%！\\n现在就能立刻起跑喔！不行吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e4be84ede1c773a727ed19218cb5be4f07129025d95e203c3619ab61bdc5bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "619"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/619"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09efb076cac6a10169733fc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟某个赛马娘并跑练习时被她说了\\n「输了就把你当小宝宝」……真是场激战啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d050309b54f0eabf47200d063754e617e057a5898d7ce2510cf7715e2399759",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "62"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/62"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a86b54d7d936d31b1bca4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你们也有精密计算过吧……不过，\\n我想到时候会要向上调整喔。不好意思啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7394812c11245634764ab0fe5239faf5f6d9df5502747f752768a4520fb0ddc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "620"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/620"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a117b06ec12773b49f63aa52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你们就在我的手掌心中\\n努力挣扎吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86d47c1a7e21c89f6ef04dea8381a88b2ab91dbda3648dd6d7930219932c2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "621"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/621"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b176be2cac80372ae3d89bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为是最重要的机密事项，\\n请容我拒绝回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91b3151f50c6c1d4810fdfe8903eb6eea38411ca8d59957011428e450c1356f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "622"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/622"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403beba5fc31ebaefffe2e3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宛如落在避雷针上的Blitz，\\n会精准地穿破终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54ec5da22c7998fe93cd1a5fce5a640f8d7f6e2c97ac28c1fdacd4dfdff54a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "623"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/623"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb71f37637f5649152229cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "非常开心……大家的声援，\\n让真机伶变得更加可爱了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e8d4f649eb5148b38720025f30d9247536e0faef7500bd88e33efc3125696d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "624"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/624"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dc69f4c19a4f5a3ed75047",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的速度和可爱都是货真价实的。\\n立刻就会呼啸而过，所以别错过喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "545c03e3948acbf7d2add526e779c7058abd5dffc1454c37ffbeaf110eb7c41b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "625"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/625"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e2b8651469a527323d3a2cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这之中一定会有王子来……哦～呵呵呵呵，\\n我的心跳得好快，快到要爆炸了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecd8bf5efc073e8d12943cce7650c6fcf6351a381be56d1d4a6265abaecce436",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "626"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/626"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:539deb33f2ef0b5bbf170814",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为公主……不，身为一个真正的公主，\\n要一路狂奔到胜者舞台！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19048128c4e76b0b7f1f4f56d76dfba50d8219078ac24e578d09b1f25e58d798",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "627"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/627"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6295400004a088a4ceb2d46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然也希望能关注我的表现，\\n不过我会带来精彩的竞赛，就好好期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dcb62b842daa9806c7bb334587dadde334a1716b98b4af3dcddfb1dabc8d1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "628"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/628"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb09b3ac308195db21a4048d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会让观众的视线都集中到我身上，\\n并让这段访谈变成首页特辑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb591138bfee6de2d52c777ae0a13edd101960ae31e534a3030492a6631339ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "629"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/629"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a95ce765c1e05f14334c1ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔喔！\\n就让你们看看我帅气的地方吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f911f637bff88dacc2edc438cbfe57aa7845c6b1876a23068d600b4bf55414ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "63"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/63"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d670556781923e5436517a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这问题问得好！虽然河堤和走廊也很难舍弃，\\n但最棒的地点还是……赛场上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66451511c11f5c405bae73d1a872ae72fdf5d62afc97ce81c5cf64e966070698",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "630"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/630"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d25ad3189eb3666bd89ce0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然！你问为什么？因为我是\\n立于强者之上的优等生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4745590c0ff5fa9f9bbeafb9e8f24d49ba9780bbe2725d4bd514b7402023db0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "631"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/631"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de9a2c30d2c4ad892ecdcc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绕日本一圈的凯旋parade！\\n还能顺便吃本地盒饭，一石二鸟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11c66f0298c3b302f1196e322d88fd2864a55119de0b5633eb06644c07c791a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "632"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/632"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb4f5e8c4468c043e7baf9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "久等了──showtime到啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6cd34aa9fe35f555120b322348142dd93d7dad709edacdfb60d41b8d5aa208",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "633"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/633"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d91639e091b1f2a49e9eef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "风风才没有紧张啦！所以现在……\\n希望你不要跟风风说话啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a35549fc36169180aff12c0d718498029a79b8cac5c8a2b79d80d2b1d41d42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "634"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/634"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b290923171122953729f71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后直线要是有人敢挡路……风风就在\\n那家伙屁股上留下超深的齿痕啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d55a314c337fb05469bfd162dc7bd346876b4e8bb8c4a249c6cae2714d7a9d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "635"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/635"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5275ada572b1c9f2c340a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她们具有相当程度的魔力，\\n但都不是我的对手呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8a3055ad29fcd8848fb43cbfed2d82fb89a1070aee22a49cdd442db1775f56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "636"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/636"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b906341699f62dc3a189b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然啰。就算在决赛时我也会让大家见识\\n魔法少女Sweepy的魔法。大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dfe5615a08608b0ab8345d26039a28238dc6b8c82b31274ef777635db4e84b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "637"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/637"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59881c8ec24ed69f1c844230",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员正在等待我的胜利。\\n……所以我要赢。绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ca6b43add6df0fd0603a918ce88f648a6b2f8b43896740659d0d4a3bb868db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "638"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/638"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f3def81f0999bba956c71c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员的1日独占券吧。\\n真想疗愈再疗愈，尽情地疗愈他～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "753b2503efc2994e58135ff212c74fd9c120dc9caf8de96bfecc94fc06ee07cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "639"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/639"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da063dd883366c51feb30f2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想放下自己的身份或称号，\\n以一名赛马娘的身份全力以赴，享受竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "552321104744c7acf4577fd2fee661b6e48ac1396915f4baf9a301b1b6e9f566",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "64"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/64"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcc35904ec669e8c0fa5376d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛也会醒目地冲刺☆\\n让大家见识赛马娘偶像一路领先到底的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "356df9d62048aa0c7a1c8373dd898997c08aff5f5e8da65bf211011ac365d6e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "640"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/640"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249d21061be4f6d8f385f130",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我绝对会赢，所以不能移开视线哟☆\\n要乖乖待在第一排正中央等喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ee62b6e4a45e353f231fe5fcd56b0a71d275696c32464410e82e69b7e2165e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "641"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/641"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02cce79125823d03fc0e9e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的故事也终于来到最高潮……\\n为了有个圆满结局，我会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d77d74f67e7257d2059c82dfeb6a99248d7937b6c339e5890e3a92baeaf7e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "642"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/642"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f8d9b6765da57ef3f9a9de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我、我是……主角！？那我说不定能成为\\n英雄……不对，是一定要成为英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018b628cf07fd9af4a197b79e41f3a366d4a633bd9c0d08401b53d1a50573379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "643"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/643"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c2f6cfe509ecd84b91a626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可不是佐敦玩笑，而是正经的喔～\\n不过啊，该说是这次让我也认真起来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "067201b85dc0d828f0b691e654f58354e264538f932e92aa65183a2042dc96d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "644"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/644"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304ebbd4b13441500324b982",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家真的都超强的耶～唉～真是的。\\n我不想输得很难看，那就只能获胜啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a00ea0274caf4e2b1acd78522ab2693968d30484672b7f8c3c367ab36d0374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "645"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/645"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fefb41a81b796e0a62841bc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……根本压抑不住。\\n但没有问题……我现在感觉好极了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1321a0064c7ad137c19e01496c1a7dfd90d2d68e177bd4f98a060e0c0340465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "646"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/646"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a695a758a360e5944c894c50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会告诉任何人。\\n反正……应该有在看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "517d349961a16251b9fd3929fbeed109eee59aad053aa081d042573a49f58973",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "647"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/647"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1709626cf153050e5869bba7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟谁啊……等赢了再考虑。\\n不先获胜就没意义了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13dcb15e57c56f60197dfa8493020f831b180a4c4e8913f0845d2753e89580e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "648"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/648"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb73778634b30321c68c62f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我要赢。我会用胜利，\\n来证明自己很强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f712d1f204db3c55d8b9199ce71eee5d02e9fd65a760c077137dfe3a144ae7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "649"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/649"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b7d267d2058c62e6aef902",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观战的时候没有服装规定，\\n自由自在地真的很棒呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c463ebd468c4bd1103b6f415422071eccbeb22876d13725fd31fd7e457941a05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "65"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/65"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c498f8816fec8fc358855d96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为有各位温暖的声援才使得花蕾开始绽放。\\n希望大家能在一旁守护花蕾盛开的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7188283d4febe235bd01f5fe633706c5909b90d5f613aeb2adba675bd4931",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "650"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/650"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4732024cd4194e71c4582d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然就算踮起脚尖也还是不够，\\n但即便如此，我还是想追上大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28220b643431f80302071d8304c41fb202a852a7b20185c85747687632f0953c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "651"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/651"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e8277e7596ca4e02dd130c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，我想要美国人在电视上说的\\n那个叫「小萝卜」的胡萝卜──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "776ba1ae8120f48a9464f49c4c673e5330f612ff71c62175767a6580ccbd2d3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "652"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/652"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54457cca40963620d79aeb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔～蜜册是什么？怎么办──我没有耶！\\n没有就不能参加决赛吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9061adfbb2c3a5ece874d02c64364aa14fa28ca6aa9c317b3352b02f30a6a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "653"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/653"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:696b467839be7aaa21734d5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有句话说「赛马娘，一入闸门便有七敌」，\\n所以每个人都是劲敌！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ef7f8fc8578115378c159b0bc058c5fef6222fa7a631c959ae9d2ac98fae04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "654"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/654"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6127981e194e0be4207b2f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！\\n呃嗯，我会像爆竹一样狂奔的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2158a5ea888b3760f88a8dbedf94a8a3a9343412952efe50329eff493ee44f9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "655"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/655"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315292a8105fdebdb2995865",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ああ、まるでヒーローショーみたいだ……\\nピンチの時は応援よろしく頼む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25937e356df896cb9500e8afcea848ad8bbc7d05b0fb75ac129d56460e565f7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "656"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/656"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ebd05db7a5670193ee0c21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "戦い続けるのみさ……。\\nそう、この世にレースがある限りッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bd397b5eba10b332088310f1b71251c053ccc89706b14dcc9018c31931e008",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "657"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/657"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56de85d14f2aa29d37f0a2b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bafc61348b902c9dd1e5d672c19d1cef2a9842aa259500df190a35cce59f36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "658"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/658"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6056bff0f11f3ba1e27cd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！尽～量期待吧！\\n我会将美丽传递给大家☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4a4ba32f0066cb54c1fd2916508f5c7c97173fdda147d2f24b1795915e2a23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "659"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/659"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0f76ab7957af31de16d977",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的，竞赛结束后我想吃面上铺满蔬菜\\n然后面的硬度偏硬的拉面当作奖励♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ba8a71638dcdbca2267e770ce262c45e88e01eaeaf6b15e50d488a8c5b362f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "66"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/66"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0894fa73ecc057c534cb05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请收下这个「能与幽灵和肩膀酸痛成为朋友的\\n护身符」！这样就会变成甜蜜的负担吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f19653df14c7eb942941a131ee9827b4eda7d0733d1bd6e090dde1b182761f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "660"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/660"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0442b1a86cbbac23c8f4f60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "运气！以及努力！于是我做完了\\n百次参拜！现在的我无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21241b31dbe02baa525c6755966c738fb11c64959a53fad41f019a6f13b954df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "661"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/661"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dcde048c6012ff49ecdbb5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为欢呼声让人心旷神怡，我就忍不住睡了个\\n午觉，结果睡过头了。多亏如此我精神超好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0221296f02ad2fbbb37f3fecd2bc6b9c9698adb636ff39c307edd6daa6f5ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "662"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/662"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d6a6c1de51e172b92bf09ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样啊，必须好好感谢呢。\\n不过我会照自己的风格去跑，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c1ca0fa2de47d035583d8f851f6096fe85c74e0d8254ac3d3720b695d45f4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "663"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/205/663"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd239dc5d72e203f82ab1366",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是，是的～为了不要妨碍到大家，\\n我会悄悄地第1个抵达终点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2dfe675a62a315af294be2a551344c4b392b959f7a9f0064affb4c85163aa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
